    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-nascor</span></b> , nātus, 3,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep.
			n.</i>, <i>to grow up under</i>, <i>out
				of</i>, or <i>after; to follow after</i>, <i>succeed</i> (not ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">num vada subnatis imo viridentur ab herbis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Hal.
					90</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui (cortex) subnascente alio expellitur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 24, 37, § 234</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 22, 34, § 84</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 3, 7, § 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castaneae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 20, 34, § 148</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pilus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 39, 94, § 230</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plumae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 23, 27, § 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulcera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Brev. Vit. 5, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aqua, id. Ira, 2, 10, 5: ignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					14, 65</span></i>
			. </div>
